{"notes":["## Summary\nVerdict: APPROVE (with minor changes) — spike 1 SSH transport simulated memenuhi AC1-4: 50 artifact pushed, p95 500ms \u003c30s, retry idempotent tmp+rename+fsync + checksum VerifyArtifact, secret redaction via SanitizeLogLine/RedactSecrets, histogram CSV + failure classification. Tidak ada blocking defect.\n\n## Findings (severity-ranked)\n\n### [Medium] Reliability — simulated_transport.go:112-119 — Partial tmp orphan\n- Problem: injected disconnect path melakukan `dstTmp.Close()` tanpa `os.Remove(tmpPath)` (komentar 'do NOT remove tmp'). Retry pakai randSuffix baru, final rename aman, tapi orphan .tmp.* menumpuk.\n- Why matters: Spike isolated tidak masalah; jika dipromote ke prod tanpa GC, disk leak dan audit bingung.\n- Suggested fix: Dokumentasikan GC eksplisit atau tambahkan cleanup deferred setelah retry sukses; untuk spike cukup komentar lifecycle tmp.\n\n### [Medium] Reliability — simulated_transport.go:137-148 — Missing directory fsync\n- Problem: fsync hanya pada file (`dstTmp.Sync()`) tidak pada parent directory setelah `os.Rename`.\n- Why matters: Power-loss bisa hilangkan directory entry rename pada filesystem tertentu (durability gap).\n- Suggested fix: Setelah Rename, `os.Open(RemoteDir); Sync(); Close()` untuk durabilitas; untuk spike catat sebagai gap prod.\n\n### [Medium] Correctness — simulated_transport.go:68-72,150-157 — Failure duration under-reported\n- Problem: Durasi failure sample diukur wall-clock (Sleep capped 100ms) sedangkan sukses override ke `calcLatency = size/throughput`. Histogram failure under-report.\n- Why matters: Failure latency tidak comparable dengan success p95.\n- Suggested fix: Override duration untuk failure juga ke calcLatency jika Throughput\u003e0, atau dokumentasikan bahwa failure bucket exclude duration.\n\n### [Low] Correctness/Maintainability — harness.go:70-74 \u0026 verify.go — Duplicate manifest parsing\n- Problem: `ExtractManifest` manual gzip/tar duplikat `artifact.ReadManifest`; `os.Stat` ignore error untuk size.\n- Why matters: Risk drift jika ManifestFile lokasi berubah.\n- Suggested fix: Ganti dengan `artifact.ReadManifest`; cek error Stat dan fail fast.\n\n### [Low] Maintainability — harness.go:253-282 — Misleading deterministic comment\n- Problem: Komentar 'deterministic per idx' tapi pakai `crypto/rand` non-deterministik; wrapper `randReader`/`incompressibleReader` membingungkan.\n- Why matters: Reproducibility misleading.\n- Suggested fix: Hapus klaim deterministic atau ganti ke math/rand seeded per idx; sederhanakan ke `rand.Read` langsung.\n\n### [Low] Reliability — harness.go:95-107 — VerifyChecksum WARN only\n- Problem: `VerifyChecksum` gagal hanya log WARN, histogram tetap Success=true.\n- Why matters: Remote corrupt bisa lolos sebagai success.\n- Suggested fix: Untuk prod gate, jadikan failure sample (Success=false) jika VerifyChecksum error.\n\n### [Low] Security — simulated_transport.go:166-203 — Redaction keyword-dependent\n- Problem: `RedactSecrets` andal keyword id_rsa/.pem/key; token acak tanpa keyword hanya tertutup via env replacement `SanitizeLogLine`.\n- Why matters: Jika logger dipanggil tanpa SanitizeLogLine bisa bocor.\n- Suggested fix: Pastikan semua log via SanitizeLogLine (sudah); opsi tambah pattern generic panjang \u003e20 char alphanumeric.\n\n### [Low] Maintainability — histogram.go:44-65 — Percentile definition\n- Problem: Percentile nearest-rank `ceil(p/100*N)-1` benar (test 11/11 pass) tapi P50 untuk N genap adalah lower-median, bukan interpolasi.\n- Why matters: Cross-tool mismatch potensial.\n- Suggested fix: Dokumentasikan definisi nearest-rank di README/komment P50/P95.\n\n## Positive Notes\n- Atomic rename via `\u003cdst\u003e.tmp.\u003crand\u003e` + `Sync()` + `Rename` benar (AC2 idempotency terbukti: FirstRemoteExists=false, ChecksumsMatch=true, ChecksumValid=true).\n- Manifest compliance benar: `artifact.Package` + `artifact.VerifyArtifact` 6 checks (archive, manifest presence, content, project identity, checksum, immutability) + `ChecksumFile` compare.\n- Histogram percentile correctness validated (P50 50ms, P95 95ms untuk 100 sample; buckets \u0026 FailureClassification benar).\n- Secret redaction coverage baik: `RedactSecrets` + `SanitizeLogLine` menutup KeyPath, .pem, DEPLOY_* env values (test `TestRedactSecrets_NoKeyPathLeak` pass).\n- Test coverage 11/11 pass; harness isolated ke `spikes/local-deploy-ssh-transport/` tidak menyentuh prod code.\n\n## Recommendation\nApprove with minor changes — temuan di atas tidak blocking; perbaiki medium/low sebelum promote ke `anvil deploy` permanen. Escalation ke primary tidak diperlukan (no blocking).\n"],"role":"review","verdict":"approve"}